<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35517" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνήλᾰτον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνελαύνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything driven in</i>: as Subst. mostly pl.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνήλατα</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλα</span>), τά,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>the four rails,</i> which make the frame <i>of a bedstead,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ξύλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					315
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.666
			</span></i> (
				Att.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραστήρια,</span> acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				155
			</span></i>): later in sg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνήλατον, τό,</span>
			<i>bedstead,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.61
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς κλίνης ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					6.616.17
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rungs</i> of a ladder, which are <i>fixed in</i> the poles or
			sides, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλίμακος ξέστ᾽ ἐνηλάτων βάθρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1179
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκρα κλιμάκων ἐνήλατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					729
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀξόνων ἐνήλατα</span>”
				<i>the pins driven into the axle, linchpins,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					1235
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνήλατον: μέρος νεώς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
